      "sourceText": "`static_cast<目标类型>(表达式)` 是 C++ 的显式类型转换语法。取得重载函数地址时，可以用它明确告诉编译器需要哪个重载版本。",
      "translatedText": "`static_cast<目标类型>(表达式)` is the explicit type conversion syntax for C++\\. When taking the address of an overloaded function, it can be used to explicitly tell the compiler which overloaded version is needed\\.",
